@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### ==========================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### ==========================================

### Register User Baru (Role: User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nama Lengkap User",
  "email": "user@ecoplan.com",
  "password": "passworduser",
  "role": "user"
}

### Register Seller Baru (Role: Seller)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Merchant Hijau Tegal",
  "email": "seller@ecoplan.com",
  "password": "passwordseller",
  "role": "seller"
}

### Login User / Seller (Menghasilkan JWT Token)
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@ecoplan.com",
  "password": "passworduser"
}

### Login Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ecoplan.com",
  "password": "passwordadmin"
}

### Variabel Global Token (Ganti token sesuai hasil response login)
@authToken = {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}


### ==========================================
### 2. WASTE DETECTION (MACHINE LEARNING)
### ==========================================

### Deteksi Sampah via Citra Gambar (Guest / Authenticated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/detections
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="sampah_baterai.jfif"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sampah_baterai.jfif
--boundary--

### Ambil Riwayat Deteksi Pengguna
GET {{baseUrl}}/detections/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Ambil Rincian Deteksi Berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/detections/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### ==========================================
### 3. WASTE GUIDES & GEMINI AI
### ==========================================

### Ambil Seluruh Panduan 10 Kategori Sampah
GET {{baseUrl}}/guides

### Ambil Panduan Berdasarkan Kategori Spesifik (Contoh: plastic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/guides/plastic

### Memicu Gemini AI untuk Saran Daur Ulang Kustom
POST {{baseUrl}}/guides/ai-suggestion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "plastic",
  "prompt": "Bagaimana cara membuat pot tanaman gantung yang estetis dari botol plastik bekas ini?"
}


### ==========================================
### 4. ARTICLES (EDUCATION & PUBLICATION)
### ==========================================

### Ambil Daftar Artikel Terpublikasi (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles?search=kompos&page=1&limit=10

### Kirim Draf Artikel Baru Lengkap dengan Skor Turnitin (User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/articles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Strategi Pengolahan Sampah Plastik Skema Ekonomi Sirkular",
  "content": "Pengolahan sampah plastik memerlukan keterlibatan aktif masyarakat melalui bank sampah dan pemilahan dari rumah...",
  "turnitin_score": 12.5
}

### Ambil Daftar Artikel Milik Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/my-articles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Baca Detail Artikel & Catat Views (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Pembaruan Draf Artikel oleh Penulis
PUT {{baseUrl}}/articles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Revisi: Strategi Pengolahan Sampah Plastik Skema Ekonomi Sirkular",
  "content": "Konten artikel yang telah diperbarui dan disempurnakan..."
}

### Review dan Moderasi Artikel oleh Admin (Status: published / rejected)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/articles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "published",
  "turnitin_score": 12.5
}

### Hapus Artikel (Penulis / Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/articles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ==========================================
### 5. MARKETPLACE, STORES & PRODUCTS
### ==========================================

### Pendaftaran Toko Baru (Mengaktifkan Role Seller)
POST {{baseUrl}}/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "store_name": "Toko Daur Ulang Mandiri Tegal",
  "store_description": "Pusat kerajinan tangan daur ulang sampah dan kompos organik berkualitas.",
  "address": "Jl. Martadiredja No. 45, Tegal, Jawa Tengah"
}

### Ambil Rincian Profil Toko Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores/my-store
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Perbarui Informasi Profil Toko
PUT {{baseUrl}}/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "store_name": "Toko Daur Ulang Mandiri Sejahtera",
  "store_description": "Pusat kompos organik dan kerajinan tangan ramah lingkungan.",
  "address": "Sleman, Yogyakarta"
}

### Tambah Produk Daur Ulang Baru ke Katalog Toko (Seller)
POST {{baseUrl}}/marketplace/products
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pupuk Kompos Organik Premium 5kg",
  "description": "Kompos murni hasil pengolahan sampah biologis dapur dan dedaunan.",
  "price": 25000,
  "stock": 100,
  "category": "biological"
}

### Ambil Seluruh Daftar Produk Marketplace (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/marketplace/products?category=biological&search=kompos&page=1&limit=10

### Ambil Rincian Detail Produk Berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/marketplace/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Ambil Daftar Produk Toko Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores/my-products
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Perbarui Informasi Produk Marketplace (Seller)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/marketplace/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pupuk Kompos Organik Super 5kg",
  "description": "Kompos murni kaya nutrisi untuk tanaman hias.",
  "price": 28000,
  "stock": 85,
  "category": "biological"
}

### Hapus Produk dari Marketplace (Seller / Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/marketplace/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ==========================================
### 6. ESCROW TRANSACTIONS & PAYMENT
### ==========================================

### Buat Transaksi Checkout & Menghasilkan Snap Token Midtrans
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "shipping_cost": 15000.00
}

### Ambil Daftar Riwayat Transaksi (User / Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?status=paid_escrow&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Ambil Rincian Detail Transaksi Berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Perbarui Alur Status Transaksi Escrow (Contoh: Konfirmasi Selesai / Completed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### Webhook Callback Otomatis dari Server Midtrans (Public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": "ECO-1741870000-12345678",
  "transaction_status": "settlement",
  "fraud_status": "accept",
  "gross_amount": "55000.00"
}

### Periksa Status Pembayaran Terkini ke Core API Midtrans
GET {{baseUrl}}/payment/status/ECO-1741870000-12345678
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Penarikan Saldo Toko Seller (Withdrawal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000.00,
  "bank_name": "BCA",
  "account_number": "1234567890",
  "account_name": "Shinta Nursobah Chairani"
}


### ==========================================
### 7. LOGISTICS & SHIPPING (RAJAONGKIR)
### ==========================================

### Cari Wilayah Pengiriman Domestik (Autocomplete / Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/logistics/destinations?search=Sleman&limit=10&offset=0

### Hitung Estimasi Ongkos Kirim Domestik (General)
POST {{baseUrl}}/logistics/shipping-cost
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": 31555,
  "destination": 68423,
  "weight": 1000,
  "courier": "jne",
  "price": "lowest"
}

### Lacak Resi Pengiriman Real-Time (General)
GET {{baseUrl}}/logistics/tracking?resi=JP123456789&courier=jne

### Hitung Estimasi Ongkos Kirim Checkout Pesanan
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipping/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": 31555,
  "destination": 68423,
  "weight": 1000,
  "courier": "jne",
  "price": "lowest"
}

### Input / Perbarui Nomor Resi Transaksi oleh Penjual (Seller / Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/shipping/receipt/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receipt_number": "JP123456789"
}

### Lacak Pengiriman Berdasarkan ID Transaksi
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipping/tracking/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000?courier=jne
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ==========================================
### 8. USER PROFILE & GAMIFICATION REWARDS
### ==========================================

### Ambil Informasi Data Diri, Saldo, dan Statistik Profil
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Perbarui Data Profil Pengguna (Nama & Email)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shinta Nursobah Chairani",
  "email": "shinta.chairani@ecoplan.com"
}

### Ambil Riwayat Transaksi & Saldo Pengguna
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Ambil Riwayat Pemindaian Deteksi Sampah Pengguna
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile/detections
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ==========================================
### 9. ADMIN YOUTUBE VIDEO MANAGEMENT
### ==========================================

### Ambil Daftar Video Edukasi YouTube (Publik / Filter Kategori)
GET {{baseUrl}}/videos?category=biological&search=kompos&page=1&limit=10

### Ambil Detail Video Berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/videos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Tambah Tautan Video YouTube Baru (Khusus Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tutorial Praktis Pembuatan Kompos Organik Skala Rumah Tangga",
  "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ",
  "description": "Panduan langkah demi langkah mengubah sampah sisa makanan dapur menjadi pupuk kompos berkualitas tinggi.",
  "category": "biological"
}

### Perbarui Data Video Edukasi (Khusus Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/videos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Revisi: Tutorial Praktis Pembuatan Kompos Organik Skala Rumah Tangga",
  "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ",
  "description": "Deskripsi yang telah diperbarui.",
  "category": "biological"
}

### Hapus Data Video Edukasi (Khusus Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/videos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}